{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>The book of the vision</b> — for it is joined, although it is torn." "<b>Burden</b> — a prophecy, what HaShem bore upon Nineveh. We do not know the generation of this prophet. It is possible that the Elkoshite is named after the name of a city, or after the name of one of his ancestors. His prophecy concerns the fall of Nineveh at the hand of Nebuchadnezzar."], :book :nahum, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nahum -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nachum"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:27.543301609Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}